{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to <i>Fill the Fox</i> \u2014 A Cozy Puzzle Journey Through a World of Foxes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere between snowy peaks, golden deserts, and enchanted forests, a group of foxes have lost their way. Your job? Guide them home\u2014one puzzle at a time.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726790/extras/b2b6e7b339409b40662525783a199096.poster.avif?t=1771020376\" width=598 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726790/extras/b2b6e7b339409b40662525783a199096.webm?t=1771020376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726790/extras/b2b6e7b339409b40662525783a199096.mp4?t=1771020376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fill the Fox</i> is a lighthearted,  puzzle game where every level solved brings a fox closer to safety. From icy dens to mystical groves, you'll travel across a beautiful world filled with charm, mystery, and gentle wonder.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve satisfying puzzles at your own pace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet and guide foxgirls from unique cultures and environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock gallery content and more about the Foxes!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726790/extras/d606659cd1ae77b595bc62397d6bc2d7.poster.avif?t=1771020376\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726790/extras/d606659cd1ae77b595bc62397d6bc2d7.webm?t=1771020376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726790/extras/d606659cd1ae77b595bc62397d6bc2d7.mp4?t=1771020376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just a puzzle game\u2014it\u2019s a calm, soulful escape into a world of warmth, beauty, and a little bit of mischief.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re ready to explore, they\u2019re ready to trust you.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Akahime: Five Filled","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3726790/618a6947df12a2b6ba70620b0c2043abab0346b3.jpg"},{"name":"Marisol: Five Filled","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3726790/b2b4a09100382e8f720d845986b1c78eb8d30fd0.jpg"},{"name":"Nyima: Five Filled","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3726790/8321243af89186c03a8c922cc26af79d9bbf35d8.jpg"},{"name":"Yukiha: Five Filled","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3726790/62151f4a7ee97063080cda55f42a0602ee3eebcd.jpg"},{"name":"Luna: Five Filled","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3726790/41bad05b6b6f1b3804e2fdafe66f92e19e3f508f.jpg"},{"name":"Yako and Nichiko: Five Filled","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3726790/7496060309730e50ee68bc8a4c86c8b77cbeccd3.jpg"},{"name":"Nayeli: Five Filled","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3726790/0d3936db3261696665e0024b77dd3ec232d3f4bb.jpg"},{"name":"Liliora: Five Filled","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3726790/0544a8c3ccf0c8a297733973106d96cbb82b896f.jpg"},{"name":"Sylvia: Five Filled","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3726790/7a049eed3cadacde956c8e72e172e870d619cc90.jpg"},{"name":"FoxxInblue: Five Filled","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps